  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>77</mn></math></p>"
  }
